nt quality of decision-making. That's a real and defensible pattern. "Iranian leadership is just broken" flattens out real variation and, honestly, lets outside actors (sanctions regimes, unilateral treaty withdrawals) off the hook for their own role in torching Iran's more pragmatic wins.
